---
---

<section class="featured-dispatch-section section-dark reveal-on-scroll" id="dispatch" aria-label="Featured Field Story">
  <div class="content-wrap">
    <div class="dispatch-frame">
      <!-- Top Meta Eyebrow -->
      <div class="dispatch-meta-bar">
        <span class="dispatch-kicker">FEATURED DISPATCH · TRIP #09</span>
        <span class="dispatch-altitude">📍 SHANGARH · 2,100M · SAINJ VALLEY</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Large Editorial Typography Headline -->
      <h2 class="dispatch-headline">
        Shangarh: The Great Himalayan Alpine Bowl.
      </h2>

      <div class="dispatch-deck">
        Three days cut off by a mountain landslide on the deodar meadow of Shangchul Mahadev. Wooden pagoda architecture, cold Himalayan spring water, and the silence that settles when motor vehicles cannot reach you.
      </div>

      <!-- Photographic Collage with Scroll Reveal -->
      <div class="dispatch-media-strip">
        <div class="dispatch-photo-primary">
          <img
            src="/images/shangarh/shangarh-1.jpg"
            alt="Shangarh alpine meadow overlooking the deodar valley"
            class="dispatch-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <span class="photo-badge">Emerald Meadow</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dispatch-photo-secondary">
          <img
            src="/images/shangarh/shangarh-2.jpg"
            alt="Kathkuni wooden architecture of Shangchul Mahadev temple"
            class="dispatch-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <span class="photo-badge">Kathkuni Temple</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Narrative Excerpt & Read Link -->
      <div class="dispatch-bottom-row">
        <div class="dispatch-excerpt">
          "The HRTC bus leaves you at Aut, and from there a smaller local bus crawls up the Sainj river gorge. Up here at 2,100 meters, horses graze on open turf where no one is allowed to build, shout, or rush."
        </div>
        <a href="/journal/shangarh-meadows" class="dispatch-read-cta">
          <span>Read Full Field Dispatch</span>
          <span class="arrow-spring">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .featured-dispatch-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #0D1614;
    position: relative;
  }

  .dispatch-frame {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #14221E;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .dispatch-meta-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .dispatch-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent-terracotta-light, #F08C7A);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .dispatch-altitude {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-sage-light);
  }

  .dispatch-headline {
    font-family: 'Newsreader', var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #FAF8F5;
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
  }

  .dispatch-deck {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-dark-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .dispatch-media-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .dispatch-photo-primary,
  .dispatch-photo-secondary {
    position: relative;
    height: 340px;
    background: #1B2925;
  }

  .dispatch-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .dispatch-frame:hover .dispatch-img {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .photo-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    background: rgba(13, 22, 20, 0.85);
    color: #FAF8F5;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .dispatch-bottom-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .dispatch-excerpt {
    font-family: 'Newsreader', var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .dispatch-read-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--accent-terracotta);
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    min-height: 44px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }

  .dispatch-read-cta:hover {
    background: var(--accent-terracotta-hover);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dispatch-frame {
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }
    .dispatch-media-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .dispatch-photo-primary,
    .dispatch-photo-secondary {
      height: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
